<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>AWD系统提醒您：你确定要打开吗？文件中可能存有一定的模因危害<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-7" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-7')">7</a></sup>。</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p><em>忽视</em></p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>好的。正在为您打开备份数据。</p>
</blockquote>
<p><em><br /></em></p>
<div class="image-container alignleft"><img src="https://ss1.bdstatic.com/70cFuXSh_Q1YnxGkpoWK1HF6hhy/it/u=2478347969,3483915862&amp;fm=26&amp;gp=0.jpg" alt="u=2478347969,3483915862&amp;fm=26&amp;gp=0.jpg" class="image" /></div>
<hr />
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>模因锁已解开</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color: #ddaadd">白沁</span></span></strong><br />
<em>白金之作饰无边</em><br />
<em>沁人心脾于青天</em></p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p><strong><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color: #aa55aa">樱野</span></span></strong><br />
<em>樱树白兮带微粉</em><br />
<em>野处正适情变迁</em></p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p><strong><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color: #8866dd">半枝</span></span></strong><br />
